SUMMARY:Healing Arts Fair
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n**✨ A Day of Healing\, Art & Community 
 ✨**\n\n**Blue Moon Salt & Sauna Healing Arts Fair**\n\n**Take a little t
 ime for yourself and join us for a welcoming day of healing sessions\, art
 \, and community connection.**\n\n**Meet local practitioners and artists\,
  explore their offerings\, and enjoy a peaceful atmosphere where you can r
 elax\, ask questions\, and discover something new. Whether you’re famili
 ar with healing arts or simply curious\, everyone is welcome!**\n\n**☕ P
 erk Up Coffee Truck will be serving coffee\, smoothies\, and snacks throug
 hout the gathering.**\n\n**A few helpful details:**\n\n**• Parking is in
  the grassy area to the left of the building.**\n**• Please keep voices 
 soft indoors while guests receive sessions.**\n**• If you’re waiting f
 or a session\, enjoy the outdoor tent area until your appointment time.**\
 n**• Payments are made directly to individual practitioners and vendors\
 ; available payment methods may vary.**\n\n**Bring a friend\, explore at y
 our own pace\, and enjoy a day dedicated to wellbeing and connection.**\n\
 n**Please share this invitation and help us spread the word!**
