SUMMARY:10/10 Fall New Moon Night at the Dome: Community Event
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n***Interested in a full Stars and Sound H
 ealing immersion? Get your tickets to the 2:00-4:00PM [StarSounds Event.](
 https://urlight.org/events/gongmasteryheiss101026/) Bring a dish and join 
 a potluck dinner\, explore the hiking paths\, and stay for Night at the Do
 me!***\n\nJoin us on 10/10 for the final Night at the Dome of 2026\, a com
 munity evening event in the Light Center’s Dome. Members of the communit
 y are invited to join Michelle: *SoulCollage® Creatrix*\, Liam: *The Ligh
 t Center Lodge Keeper\,* and special guest David Heiss: *Evolutionary Astr
 ologer\, Sound Alchemist & Sacred Ceremony Facilitator* as we create a Hea
 rt Centered Unity Field.\n\nThe “New Moon” represents a cosmic reset b
 utton for new beginnings\, intention setting and fresh starts. As we enter
  the last quarter of 2026\, the days grow shorter and colder\, winter is c
 oming.\n\nNight at the Dome has become an evening of light hearted communi
 ty with others of the spiritual community. It is a free flow event that in
 cludes:\n\n* meet and greet\n* opening welcome messages\n* upcoming announ
 cements\n* light and sound experiences\n* Light Room Sessions\n* candle li
 t labyrinth walks\n* fire pit drum circle and more\n\nThis is a donation b
 ased event open to all. Love offerings and donations benefit the Light Cen
 ter and United Research. Bring your energy\, light\, water\, journal/pen\,
  seating preferences\, a musical instrument (non-electric) and any sacred 
 implement for charging.\n\nVisit [UR Light Website](https://urlight.org/ev
 ents/natd1010/) to learn more.
