SUMMARY:New Moon Ceremony
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n### **Walking in Balance**\n\n*Finding Ha
 rmony Within Ourselves and Our Relationships*\n\nAs the seasons change and
  the days grow shorter\, nature reminds us that life is always seeking bal
 ance.\nThere are times to give and times to receive. Times to speak and ti
 mes to listen. Times to hold on—and times to let go.\nBut in the busynes
 s of everyday life\, it is easy to lose that balance.\n\nWe may give so mu
 ch to others that we neglect ourselves. We may hold onto responsibilities\
 , expectations\, relationships\, or old stories long after they have becom
 e too heavy to carry.\n\nThis New Moon invites us to pause and ask:\n**Whe
 re in my life am I being called back into balance?**\n\nJoin us for our mo
 nthly sacred virtual New Moon gathering as we step away from the noise of 
 everyday life and create space to listen within.\nTogether\, we will use m
 editation\, reflection\, intention\, and shamanic practice to explore wher
 e our lives may have moved out of balance—and what small changes might h
 elp us return to a place of greater harmony.\n\nThis month's journey will 
 consist of a limited past life regression.\n\nYou do not need any previous
  experience with meditation or shamanic practice.\nSimply come as you are.
 \n\n-Shaman Phil
