SUMMARY:Art Church - Make Art from a Slow Quiet Place - ONLINE
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nHosted by Tish Sjoberg\n\n2nd and 4th Sun
 days\n\nNow On-Line during Covid-19 Quarantine\n10:00 a.m. – 12:15 p.m.\
 n$0 - $25 (Included in our monthly pass)\n\nSlow down and be with yourself
  through art making. A rich morning that feeds your spirit\, rests your bo
 dy\, quiets your mind and helps you remember who you are!\n\nHere we will 
 use the arts to have a conversation with ourselves and connect to our long
 ings and gifts. This is not about religion\, yet in the inquiry you may ch
 oose to make connections to your religious beliefs.\n\nThe format: We chec
 k in as a group\, we may do a little drumming\, have 5 minutes of quiet/re
 flection/meditation/prayer/relaxation time\, go create art in silence (wit
 hout talking) doing our own thing and then come back together to honor wha
 t we spent our time doing.\n\nArt making can be painting\, writing\, sand 
 tray\, collage\, doodling\, scribbling\, sewing\, mixed media\, movement\,
  or…. No previous art experience necessary just the willingness to follo
 w what you are attracted to and moving slow and quiet.
