SUMMARY:Reiki Chakra Tune Up
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n**Join us for a 25-minute Reiki distance 
 healing session to ground\, clear\, and protect your energy through tuning
  your chakras.**\n**Reiki involves channeling healing energy through the p
 ractitioner’s hands to promote physical\, emotional\, and spiritual well
 being in the recipient.**\n**I will help channel universal life force ener
 gy (Reiki) through time and space for you to create space for deep relaxat
 ion and healing.**\n**If you are having any negative feelings or just want
  to relax\, then this Chakra cleansing meditation is for you. This session
  will help you clear blockages and release any attachments that do not ser
 ve your higher purpose. This healing meditation will leave you feeling pea
 ceful\, relaxed\, and more yourself.**\n**This guided meditation helps to 
 release negative energy within the body and surrounding aura. As you go th
 rough this meditation\, allow yourself to remain open and in alignment wit
 h the universal energy that is being sent to you.**\n**The session may inc
 lude music\, vibrations\, and guided practices to enhance the energy flow.
 **\n**I hope to see you there!**\n\n**Shaman Phil**
